# Plank making
Logs into planks at a sawmill.

```table
Method                Cost  Profit    ROI
-------------------  -----  ------  -----
Make Mahogany plank  1,609     496  30.8%
Make Oak plank         292     214  73.3%
Make Teak plank        633     112  17.7%
Make Plank             124      17  13.7%
```
=> /ge/calc-plank/plank-mahogany Make Mahogany plank
=> /ge/calc-plank/plank-oak Make Oak plank
=> /ge/calc-plank/plank-teak Make Teak plank
=> /ge/calc-plank/plank-plank Make Plank

## Notes
* gp/hour uses a typical action rate for the method and assumes you never wait on a buy offer. Treat it as an upper bound.
* Rows marked "no price" reference an item nobody has traded recently, so no profit can be computed for them honestly.

=> https://grandexchange.dreamstation.systems/calc/plank This page on the web
